OL,3,GNEWSATwo injured after M8 crash sparks
OL,4,Along delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people were treated for minor
OL,7,Finjuries after a crash caused long
OL,8,Fdelays on the M8 outside Edinburgh.
OL,10,FTraffic was queued back for nine miles
OL,11,Ffollowing the incident near the
OL,12,FHermiston Gait turnoff at about 06:20.
OL,14,FDelays lasted for several hours, with
OL,15,Fsome motorists remaining in traffic for
OL,16,Fup to 60 minutes before the congestion
OL,17,Fcleared.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
