OL,3,GNEWSATwo injured after M8 crash sparks
OL,4,Along delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Scottish
OL,7,FAmbulance Service said two people had
OL,8,Fbeen treated at the scene and
OL,9,Fdischarged. Police Scotland has been
OL,10,Fcontacted for comment.
